WEBVTT

00:00:00.910 --> 00:00:02.460
Luca!

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:07.320
Why did you intentionally go for a draw?

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.160
It's better than losing.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.080
I wouldn't have been able to win anyway.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.100
But…

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.600
Lua doesn't remember 
anything?  But I heard him.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:25.080
Luca, I'll protect you.  So you 
have to protect that world.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.140
Like I thought, you're a Signer!

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:33.190
What was he talking about?  What's a Signer?

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.440
Luca, do you feel sick?

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.690
Yeah.  You were also dazed during the duel.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:46.350
No, I'm fine.

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:49.670
I'll take you two home today.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.320
That would be good.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:54.530
Really?  Then stay with us tonight.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.090
Everybody listen!

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:01.440
The action-packed first day of 
the tournament is now complete!

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:04.820
These are the matchups for 
tomorrow's semifinals!

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:11.200
Today's excitement will 
continue in tomorrow's duels!

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.880
Goodbye!

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:20.580
Yusei is battling against that man tomorrow.

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:28.400
He's a tough opponent.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:29.380
Yeah.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:31.850
If it's going to be a Riding Duel,

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:34.810
I'm looking forward to finding out 
what kind of D-Wheel Bommer rides.

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:39.830
That man's D-Wheel…

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:45.070
Oh yeah!  If we know what he's riding 
beforehand, Yusei will have the advantage.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:47.170
What's wrong?

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:49.880
Oh, it's nothing.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:53.730
You go home first.  I just remembered 
I have to run an errand.

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:55.730
What errand?

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:58.570
Umm, what was the errand?

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:00.650
I'll try to remember.

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:04.000
Lua?

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:31.360
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:36.390
That's deeply engraved into us

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:44.920
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:50.860
Break through even further

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:56.450
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:03.510
There's always only one truth

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:07.350
So feel the voice of your heart

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:12.210
With your unwavering emotions

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:18.230
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:53.650
Unwavering FeelingsMy Mission Is 
For My Hometown and My Friends

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:16.510
We'll load the recycling materials tonight.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.960
We'll be finished by the departure time.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:23.720
Do what you want until 
then.  Don't go too crazy!

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:25.050
Right!

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:30.600
If you want to go to the Satellite 
black market, it's this way!

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:36.820
The only things you won't find are fresh 
food and a wife, and it's cheaper than the City!

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:38.920
Get on board!

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:40.280
Thanks.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:43.280
Hey, mister.  Thanks!

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:00.910
Here's the card you were asking for.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.310
Yes it is.

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.690
It's a powerful card.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:10.050
If you use it, you'll win.

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:12.230
I'm counting on you.

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:18.400
You must awaken Yusei 
Fudo's nature as a Signer.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:20.820
I understand.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:23.240
And when I fulfill your goal…

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:29.510
Kaiba Corporation will 
help rebuild your village.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:33.420
How long have you been 
away from your hometown?

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:36.560
One year and 116 days.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.560
You must miss it.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:43.540
I do.  Therefore, I will complete the mission

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:47.460
so that I can return to my 
hometown as fast as possible.

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:07.470
You're in the way.

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:11.060
I apologize, King.

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:15.260
I'm saying that your very 
existence is in my way.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:20.660
Yusei is going to win this tournament.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:23.100
Only I'm capable of defeating him.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:26.510
Your battle against him 
will be a waste of time.

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:28.070
Jack...

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.970
You are a pitiful King.

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:40.090
You don't realize your own mission yet.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:42.880
Mission?

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.030
I have a mission.

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.940
A mission that someone like you can't stop.

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:09.810
This is Bommer's garage.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:29.160
Ouch...

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:32.860
Bommer's D-Wheel should be here.

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:42.240
It's a ghost!

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:47.510
Lua's late.

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:51.840
He'll miss the hamburgers, 
which is his favorite food.

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:58.540
I'll look for him.  Something 
might have happened to him.

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:00.560
I'm going too.

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:02.020
Luca, you stay and rest.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.630
My body is fine now.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.660
I'll feel more sick if I 
have to stay here and wait.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.790
I understand.  But don't overexert yourself.

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:28.200
He's...

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:51.230
Saiga, please beware of Security.

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:52.930
I know.

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:17.220
That's the place.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:35.730
Rally!

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:36.820
Blitz!

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:37.720
Nerve!

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:38.860
Taka!

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:43.220
There's no need to be suspicious.  
I've come here at Yusei's request.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:55.340
Something must have happened.

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:06.480
Did you find him?

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.480
No, I didn't.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:12.460
Neither did I.  I searched 
from here to the stadium.

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.080
Saiga?

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:20.890
Yusei, I just arrived at 
your hideout in Satellite.

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:22.990
Is everyone okay?

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:26.470
Sorry, but no one's here.

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.420
What?  What happened?

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:30.810
I don't know.

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:37.030
However, I hacked into the network, and 
there's no indication that Security captured them.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:41.310
I'll continue to look for them.

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:44.280
I can't risk continuing this transmission.

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:46.810
I'll contact you if I learn anything.

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:47.930
Thanks.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:54.760
Yusei, your friends are also missing?

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:55.740
Yeah.

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:59.060
Everyone, be safe.

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:04.910
Yusei, look!

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.810
Lua!

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:41.520
Why do you have him?

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:43.940
I'll explain later.

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:47.420
He's not hurt.  He's just sleeping.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:14.480
Why did you have him?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.720
He was sleeping in my garage.

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:19.350
Garage?

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:23.330
The security system activated, 
and he was trapped inside.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:27.690
He probably came to spy on my D-Wheel.

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:29.900
I see.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:32.290
Don't punish him.

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:37.130
I know that you didn't order him to spy.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.480
You're not a sneaky person.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:47.130
That kid likes you.  He did that 
because he was thinking of you.

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:53.240
When I see those kids, they remind me of my younger 
brother and sister that I left behind in my hometown.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:55.290
You have siblings?

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:58.980
Yes.  They're about the same age as them.

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:07.410
You can't see the stars from this city.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:14.590
Yusei, why do you fight?

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.480
I fight for my hometown.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:18.550
I see.

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:22.640
Then we're alike.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:25.380
You also fight for your hometown?

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:30.910
I came from the other side of the world.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:38.380
According to the Inca legends, my people are the 
descendants of those who served the people of the stars.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:44.680
Does that mean you know the 
story of the Crimson Dragon?

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:46.170
Yes.

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:51.670
After a long time, the Crimson Dragon 
is now trying to revive here.

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:58.000
Director Godwin wants to use its power 
to lead the world in a better direction.

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:01.610
Do you believe him?

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:07.670
Yusei, I know you understand because 
you also came from a poor background.

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:12.720
My village suffered constantly 
from poverty and discrimination.

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:19.610
The director promised that if I helped 
him, he will rebuild my village.

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:23.120
Bommer, don't trust him.

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:28.990
We're alike, but our stances are different.

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:32.740
Neither of us will waver 
from what we believe in.

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.000
That's why we'll duel.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:39.070
That's right.  We'll settle things.

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:47.730
It was good to find out that 
you're a duelist with honor.

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:51.910
But don't forget.  I'm going to win.

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:54.350
That's my mission.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:07.430
It's finally the second 
day of the tournament!

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:13.520
Whether you like it or not, the King's 
challenger will be determined in today's duels!

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:16.110
In the first battle of the semifinals,

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:21.710
it's Satellite's shooting star Yusei 
Fudo versus the black storm Bommer!

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:26.550
Where's Lua?

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:29.500
He said that he had to talk to Yusei.

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:34.730
Yusei…

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:37.310
I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:39.570
I…

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:41.960
I know.  Don't say anything.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:48.340
However, whether I win or lose, you have 
to apologize to Bommer after the duel.

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:52.120
Right, I promise!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:00.170
Yusei, do your best!

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:25.190
Hey, big brother!

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:47.070
What's that sound?

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:56.160
What's that?

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.760
Is it an elephant?  Is it a dinosaur?

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:03.310
No, it's Bommer's D-Wheel!

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:15.590
What's that?  I've never 
seen a D-Wheel like that!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:16.870
Luca!

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:18.860
Lua, look!

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:24.340
That's…

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:27.450
So what I saw was a D-Wheel.

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:37.280
Show me your important mission.

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:48.950
I might accidentally squash your D-Wheel.

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:52.570
Just because a D-Wheel is bigger 
doesn't mean that it's better.

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:56.130
I will win this duel!

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:59.050
Actually, I must win this duel!

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:04.900
Set on the Field Spell Speed World!

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:08.570
Duel mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:14.070
The field is now controlled by Speed World.

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:17.180
The only spells that can be 
activated are Speed Spells!

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:19.390
Here I go, Yusei!

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.180
Riding duel...

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:24.810
Acceleration!

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:31.060
I go first.

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:32.070
I draw!

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:39.780
I summon a monster from my hand!  Appear!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.550
Spell Reactor・RE!

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:47.760
I set three cards and end my turn!

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:52.330
My turn.

00:18:56.470 --> 00:19:01.840
Since Bommer's D-Wheel is huge, 
even Yusei is having a hard time.

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:03.250
Yusei…

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:05.860
I set one card.

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:08.490
Then I summon Speed Warrior!

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:16.490
At this moment, my trap activates!

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:17.870
Hidden Soldiers!

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:21.170
With this trap, when you summon a monster,

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:25.130
I can Special Summon a Level 4-or-below 
Dark Attribute monster from my hand.

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:30.340
I Special Summon Trap Reactor・Y FI!

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:35.770
He's fast!  He already 
summoned another monster.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.290
But Yusei also has a plan.

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:43.390
Speed Warrior's attack points are 
doubled on the turn that it's summoned.

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:47.140
Go, Speed Warrior!

00:19:47.140 --> 00:19:48.760
Sonic Edge!

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:58.520
What?

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:00.300
That was weak, Yusei!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:05.570
I've already activated the 
trap card Fake Explosion!

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:09.070
This card protects my 
monster from your attack,

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:12.820
and I can Special Summon a 
Level 5 monster from my hand.

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:16.150
Appear, Summon Reactor・SK!

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:23.750
There are three of them!

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:26.490
Then what's next will be...

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:33.610
I activate the new trap card Delta Reactor!

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:38.480
This card sends Summon Reactor・SK, 
Trap Reactor・Y FI

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:42.380
and Spell Reactor・RE from 
the field to the graveyard.

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:48.870
It's coming!

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:53.760
Appear, Flying Fortress SKY FIRE!

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:12.160
Bommer summoned his ace 
monster on the second turn!

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:23.400
With Flying Fortress SKY FIRE, once during 
the opponent's turn, if you Normal Summon,

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:30.340
Special Summon or set a card, that card is 
destroyed and you take 800 points of damage.

00:21:35.840 --> 00:21:39.380
Yusei, now you won't be able to do anything!

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:44.880
I'll win and accomplish my mission!

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:10.030
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:15.420
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.800 --> 00:22:21.350
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:26.580
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:29.740
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:35.330
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:42.490
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.620 --> 00:22:47.890
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:53.830
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:54.130 --> 00:22:59.170
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.710 --> 00:23:05.240
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:05.380 --> 00:23:14.650
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
